{
    "_comment": [
        "Batched GEMM on every gfx1250 TDM pipeline: comp_tdm, comp_tdm_v2, comp_tdm_pc",
        "(producer/consumer; the batched kernel arms its named barriers) with the tdm epilogue, and",
        "comp_tdm_v3 with the cshuffle epilogue (its wave maps are 2x2x1 and 4x4x1; comp_tdm_v2",
        "takes 4 waves). Unpadded: TDM clips every shape, except that the CShuffle epilogue of",
        "comp_tdm_v3 needs N to be a multiple of tile_n.",
        "Usage: python batched_gemm_full_benchmark.py batched_gemm/configs/tdm_config_gfx1250.json",
        "  --arch gfx1250 --dtype bf16 --layout rcr --verify"
